      <div class="closing"><h2>Final Thoughts</h2><p>Changing spark plugs is a small job with a useful lesson attached: the right part, clean access, careful threading and correct specification matter more than rushing. The spark may be tiny, but it is doing important work.</p></div>
    </article>
